<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Details about the Method and Implementation</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Details of Hallucination Self-Injection</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For a preferred response with <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math> sentences and an injection rate of <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ρ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho</annotation></semantics></math>, the number of the sentence to be replaced is rounded <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho L</annotation></semantics></math>. If the number is zero, the sample will be discarded.
Note that the first sentence in the preferred response is excluded from weighted sampling, to avoid insufficient previous text for hallucination completion.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The average sentence number is <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>5.5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5.5</annotation></semantics></math> for responses generated by LLaVA-v1.5-7B on the source dataset of LLaVA-detail-23k <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib22" title="" class="ltx_ref">Liu et al. (2024d)</a></cite>. The corresponding SI-23k dataset with <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ρ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho</annotation></semantics></math> set to 0.2 contains 23,196 samples after discarding invalid samples.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A1.T4.2" class="ltx_block ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:327.8pt;">
<div id="A1.T4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.T4.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="551.9" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 453.51 551.9" width="453.51"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,551.9) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 546 C 0 549.26 2.64 551.9 5.91 551.9 L 447.6 551.9 C 450.86 551.9 453.51 549.26 453.51 546 L 453.51 5.91 C 453.51 2.64 450.86 0 447.6 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 546 C 1.97 548.17 3.73 549.94 5.91 549.94 L 447.6 549.94 C 449.78 549.94 451.54 548.17 451.54 546 L 451.54 5.91 C 451.54 3.73 449.78 1.97 447.6 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 521.52)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:29.65em;--ltx-fo-height:1.2em;--ltx-fo-depth:36.69em;font-size:10pt;" height="524.35" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 16.6)" width="410.27"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
