<span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">“There is a &lt;hal-object&gt;”</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">“There are &lt;hal-object&gt;”</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">“&lt;hal-object&gt;can also be seen”</span></span>
</span></span>
