<span id="A1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">“&lt;hal-object&gt;can be seen”</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">“You can see a &lt;hal-object&gt;”</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I1.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I1.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
