<span id="A1.I1.i11.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i11.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">“In the image, there is a &lt;hal-object&gt;”</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I1.i12" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
