<span id="A1.I1.i13.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i13.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">“On the left, a &lt;hal-object&gt;is present”</span></span>
</span></span>
